Re-roll procedure
-----------------
1. Pick a release tag from https://github.com/bblanchon/pdfium-binaries/releases
2. Download the asset, record its SHA-256.
3. Update PDFIUM_TAG / PDFIUM_VERSION / sha_for_platform() in fetch_pdfium.sh
   AND the table above. Both, in the same commit.
4. Re-run fetch_pdfium.sh; diff ./licenses against the previous set and
   re-check THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES if anything moved (§7.8's warning that AGG
   went permissive -> GPL between 2.4 and 2.5 is exactly this failure mode).
5. Re-run the pdf-engine tests.

This procedure is the bootstrap's stand-in for SP-1 revised criterion 6
("a documented, scripted re-roll procedure"). It is scripted and documented,
but it re-rolls someone else's build, which is the part still owed.
